(5019661, 732782, 98408, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Although, I would have either put older shoes on the smaller child or no shoes at all. Great picture otherwise.</td>', 'I really like this. Although, I would have either put older shoes on the smaller child or no shoes at all. Great picture otherwise.', '2008-10-22 02:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
