(5019678, 732396, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great photo, too staged for my taste, thus does not represent poverty. With that beautiful hair and clean finger nails, it''s just not believable. Maybe I''m wrong! I hope not!</td>', 'Great photo, too staged for my taste, thus does not represent poverty. With that beautiful hair and clean finger nails, it''s just not believable. Maybe I''m wrong! I hope not!', '2008-10-22 03:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
