(5020562, 732396, 88204, '<td valign="top">This has a hint of being staged. The girl looks pristine (e.g. well-washed hair) so it leads me to think it''s staged, which lowers the authenticity. If it''s the real thing it''s an outstanding shot. If it''s staged then it comes down a hint but is still a very nice shot. I''ll rate assuming it''s the real thing. 9</td>', 'This has a hint of being staged. The girl looks pristine (e.g. well-washed hair) so it leads me to think it''s staged, which lowers the authenticity. If it''s the real thing it''s an outstanding shot. If it''s staged then it comes down a hint but is still a very nice shot. I''ll rate assuming it''s the real thing. 9', '2008-10-22 14:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
