(5021691, 732657, 37252, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting a sense of poverty here. I often find myself with no more than one dollar in my pocket, but I am not poor. This just doesn''t convery the emotion of poverty to me.</td>', 'I''m not getting a sense of poverty here. I often find myself with no more than one dollar in my pocket, but I am not poor. This just doesn''t convery the emotion of poverty to me.', '2008-10-23 02:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021696, 732460, 37252, '<td valign="top">I''ve spent several minutes now looking at this. My first reaction...an old object someone has discarded outside. Second....an old fashioned washer that was the norm at one time. I just cannot get to where I feel poverty. To the person who could never afford this, and they had to use rocks, this was a luxury.</td>', 'I''ve spent several minutes now looking at this. My first reaction...an old object someone has discarded outside. Second....an old fashioned washer that was the norm at one time. I just cannot get to where I feel poverty. To the person who could never afford this, and they had to use rocks, this was a luxury.', '2008-10-23 02:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021699, 732249, 37252, '<td valign="top">Truly emotive. A sad but typical scene - blind person that society should be reaching out to but is not. <br/>Technicals could be better. The focus is off and the highlights blown out.</td>', 'Truly emotive. A sad but typical scene - blind person that society should be reaching out to but is not. Technicals could be better. The focus is off and the highlights blown out.', '2008-10-23 02:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021700, 731760, 37252, '<td valign="top">harsh lighting, poor focus, and not really that emotive.</td>', 'harsh lighting, poor focus, and not really that emotive.', '2008-10-23 02:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021707, 732784, 37252, '<td valign="top">A but busy - the person really gets lost amongst the background. At first this bothered me, but after spending a few minutes looking at it, I like it. It adds to the message of cold and lonely - lost to everything around them. Very emotive when you spend time with it.</td>', 'A but busy - the person really gets lost amongst the background. At first this bothered me, but after spending a few minutes looking at it, I like it. It adds to the message of cold and lonely - lost to everything around them. Very emotive when you spend time with it.', '2008-10-23 02:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021714, 732473, 37252, '<td valign="top">Good perspective. I''m not sure I really would call this poverty since I am not led to believe this is someone''s home. It could just be an old boat house.</td>', 'Good perspective. I''m not sure I really would call this poverty since I am not led to believe this is someone''s home. It could just be an old boat house.', '2008-10-23 02:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021717, 732877, 37252, '<td valign="top">A typical house front from the poorer side of town. Focus seems good. The foreground is a bit too bright. Had a person been sitting out on that porch looking as tired and worn as the house I think it would have been better.</td>', 'A typical house front from the poorer side of town. Focus seems good. The foreground is a bit too bright. Had a person been sitting out on that porch looking as tired and worn as the house I think it would have been better.', '2008-10-23 02:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021718, 732893, 37252, '<td valign="top">Very interesting perspective. Nice colors.</td>', 'Very interesting perspective. Nice colors.', '2008-10-23 02:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021723, 732751, 37252, '<td valign="top">I think I see what you were going for: too poor to be able to plug in the heater. What doesn''t fit is why she would be sitting in a corner by a window looking at the cold rain. Seems to me she would be seeking out the warmest part of the house. Aside form that, technicals are okay. Focus is good. Color cast gives the viewer the feeling of how cold the woman is. The lighting could have been better as the shadow is distracting.</td>', 'I think I see what you were going for: too poor to be able to plug in the heater. What doesn''t fit is why she would be sitting in a corner by a window looking at the cold rain. Seems to me she would be seeking out the warmest part of the house. Aside form that, technicals are okay. Focus is good. Color cast gives the viewer the feeling of how cold the woman is. The lighting could have been better as the shadow is distracting.', '2008-10-23 02:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021775, 732028, 37252, '<td valign="top">Crop seems tight, but the message in adequately conveyed</td>', 'Crop seems tight, but the message in adequately conveyed', '2008-10-23 03:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021777, 731842, 37252, '<td valign="top">the straight on perspective makes look pretty flat. I see an old un-kept building, but that alone does not mean poverty.</td>', 'the straight on perspective makes look pretty flat. I see an old un-kept building, but that alone does not mean poverty.', '2008-10-23 03:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021782, 732704, 37252, '<td valign="top">Very grey and dreary. I see a condemned building. Does that mean poverty? Maybe, maybe not. Technicals: contrast could use a boost. Focus is a bit soft. Perspective is interesting.</td>', 'Very grey and dreary. I see a condemned building. Does that mean poverty? Maybe, maybe not. Technicals: contrast could use a boost. Focus is a bit soft. Perspective is interesting.', '2008-10-23 03:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021789, 731719, 37252, '<td valign="top">Good composition and crop. Colors are on target - not over saturated. Maybe a different color shirt would have been a better choice as the black background is good, but then with the shirt makes the person''s torso disappear</td>', 'Good composition and crop. Colors are on target - not over saturated. Maybe a different color shirt would have been a better choice as the black background is good, but then with the shirt makes the person''s torso disappear', '2008-10-23 03:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021837, 732649, 27161, '<td valign="top">I don''t think your post processing supports the picture. I''m guessing but it looks like you used too much noise reduction.  <br/> <br/>Also, the street kid is barely in the photo.  The beautiful view is overwhelmingly nice, but it doesn''t add to an impoverished feel.  Although it is a sad situation I think it could have been captured better without worrying so much about the scenery.</td>', 'I don''t think your post processing supports the picture. I''m guessing but it looks like you used too much noise reduction.   Also, the street kid is barely in the photo.  The beautiful view is overwhelmingly nice, but it doesn''t add to an impoverished feel.  Although it is a sad situation I think it could have been captured better without worrying so much about the scenery.', '2008-10-23 06:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021841, 731319, 27161, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what you are trying go convey here.</td>', 'I don''t understand what you are trying go convey here.', '2008-10-23 06:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021842, 732884, 27161, '<td valign="top">His clothes look a little too tidy for a hobo.</td>', 'His clothes look a little too tidy for a hobo.', '2008-10-23 06:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021844, 732799, 27161, '<td valign="top">I do get tired of the photos of people''s hands with a little change in them, but this is really well composed.  The dirtiness of the hand and the shadows give it a great feeling.</td>', 'I do get tired of the photos of people''s hands with a little change in them, but this is really well composed.  The dirtiness of the hand and the shadows give it a great feeling.', '2008-10-23 06:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
