(5022152, 732784, 10878, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot...  the train tracks are such a strong metaphor (progress, commerce, "the other side of the tracks").  They balance the image well and provide a nice thematic contrast.  I''d be curious to see what else could be done with this shot under looser editing rules.  Good job.</td>', 'I really like this shot...  the train tracks are such a strong metaphor (progress, commerce, "the other side of the tracks").  They balance the image well and provide a nice thematic contrast.  I''d be curious to see what else could be done with this shot under looser editing rules.  Good job.', '2008-10-23 13:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022162, 732805, 10878, '<td valign="top">Strong composition...  I like the how the man''s posture and possessions mimic the graphics of the advertisement.  Great stuff.</td>', 'Strong composition...  I like the how the man''s posture and possessions mimic the graphics of the advertisement.  Great stuff.', '2008-10-23 13:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022177, 732709, 10878, '<td valign="top">I''m torn over images like this.  It''s a beautiful shot, but for this theme it doesn''t work for me.  Here''s my reasoning...  simply put, poverty is a human condition.  This house speaks to me of abandonment.</td>', 'I''m torn over images like this.  It''s a beautiful shot, but for this theme it doesn''t work for me.  Here''s my reasoning...  simply put, poverty is a human condition.  This house speaks to me of abandonment.', '2008-10-23 13:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022190, 732875, 10878, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, but I don''t get the idea of poverty from this at all.</td>', 'Lovely shot, but I don''t get the idea of poverty from this at all.', '2008-10-23 13:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022283, 732805, 69668, '<td valign="top">This image tells a real story.  Nicely composed....I love that you kept the writing on the bus stop in the image.  It says so much. 10</td>', 'This image tells a real story.  Nicely composed....I love that you kept the writing on the bus stop in the image.  It says so much. 10', '2008-10-23 15:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022288, 732698, 69668, '<td valign="top">A very compelling image.  I like the crop.  I do wish it was a bit tighter just to see her leg a bit more.  Otherwise, powerful image.9</td>', 'A very compelling image.  I like the crop.  I do wish it was a bit tighter just to see her leg a bit more.  Otherwise, powerful image.9', '2008-10-23 15:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022294, 732781, 69668, '<td valign="top">THis is really well done, with great tonal range, mood, and a story.  The title is well suited. 10</td>', 'THis is really well done, with great tonal range, mood, and a story.  The title is well suited. 10', '2008-10-23 15:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022296, 732382, 68947, '<td valign="top">This one really made me sad and has emoted something from me.  It was a capture that has made a statement and that is worthy of a great score from me! 9</td>', 'This one really made me sad and has emoted something from me.  It was a capture that has made a statement and that is worthy of a great score from me! 9', '2008-10-23 15:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022306, 732249, 68947, '<td valign="top">The "Plea" that I see on this man''s face, truly captures the poverty.  Really a great capture!  I''m sure that you''re getting some dings because of the focus but, to me, this shot is worthy of a great mark.  Technical merit is not what photography should be about.  It''s what you capture, not HOW you capture it.  Too many DPCers are ignoring this and too many technically well done shots are winning that have NO real essence or value to them.  This is a 10 from me for a tremendously emotive shot!</td>', 'The "Plea" that I see on this man''s face, truly captures the poverty.  Really a great capture!  I''m sure that you''re getting some dings because of the focus but, to me, this shot is worthy of a great mark.  Technical merit is not what photography should be about.  It''s what you capture, not HOW you capture it.  Too many DPCers are ignoring this and too many technically well done shots are winning that have NO real essence or value to them.  This is a 10 from me for a tremendously emotive shot!', '2008-10-23 15:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022310, 732698, 68947, '<td valign="top">Love the way that you cropped this and the meaning behind the crop!  It says to me, personally that the person is not the "poverty" but their outstretched hand and the amputated limb IS!  Nicely done!  10</td>', 'Love the way that you cropped this and the meaning behind the crop!  It says to me, personally that the person is not the "poverty" but their outstretched hand and the amputated limb IS!  Nicely done!  10', '2008-10-23 15:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022313, 732396, 68947, '<td valign="top">Great concept...love the photography itself as it''s very well done but, it seems a little too "staged".  8</td>', 'Great concept...love the photography itself as it''s very well done but, it seems a little too "staged".  8', '2008-10-23 15:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022315, 732884, 68947, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Wonderfully photographed.  A little too staged but, meets the challenge criteria 7</td>', 'Cute!  Wonderfully photographed.  A little too staged but, meets the challenge criteria 7', '2008-10-23 15:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022320, 732124, 68947, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot but, why so small?  It would have shone in a larger size!  7</td>', 'This is a really nice shot but, why so small?  It would have shone in a larger size!  7', '2008-10-23 15:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022321, 732415, 68947, '<td valign="top">WOW, this really got to me!  Fabulous capture!!! 10</td>', 'WOW, this really got to me!  Fabulous capture!!! 10', '2008-10-23 15:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022323, 731796, 68947, '<td valign="top">I really like that you got a moving hand in this shot!  It''s a truly emotive shot and really well done!!! 10</td>', 'I really like that you got a moving hand in this shot!  It''s a truly emotive shot and really well done!!! 10', '2008-10-23 15:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022324, 731650, 68947, '<td valign="top">Love the tone that you''ve put to this shot!  It really fits well! 9</td>', 'Love the tone that you''ve put to this shot!  It really fits well! 9', '2008-10-23 15:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022325, 732704, 68947, '<td valign="top">Simple but, truly effective!  8</td>', 'Simple but, truly effective!  8', '2008-10-23 15:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022327, 732446, 68947, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Getting a shot like this with the poster behind him!!!  Really well captured!!!  I think it would have done terrifically well in b&amp;w as well but, this really was a fabulous capture!  9</td>', 'WOW!  Getting a shot like this with the poster behind him!!!  Really well captured!!!  I think it would have done terrifically well in b&w as well but, this really was a fabulous capture!  9', '2008-10-23 15:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022329, 732714, 68947, '<td valign="top">Kind of an "oxymoron" statement, isn''t it? LOL  Still, it''s a statement if one were to look deeply enough.  I like the concept of this shot! 8</td>', 'Kind of an "oxymoron" statement, isn''t it? LOL  Still, it''s a statement if one were to look deeply enough.  I like the concept of this shot! 8', '2008-10-23 15:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022332, 732746, 68947, '<td valign="top">OUCH.....this one made me want to cry!  wonderfully edited...very artistic flare to a real statement shot!  9</td>', 'OUCH.....this one made me want to cry!  wonderfully edited...very artistic flare to a real statement shot!  9', '2008-10-23 15:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022337, 732759, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really an emotive shot!  I wish we could have seen more face but, the silhouetted figure speaks volumes!  9</td>', 'Really an emotive shot!  I wish we could have seen more face but, the silhouetted figure speaks volumes!  9', '2008-10-23 15:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022358, 732637, 31664, '<td valign="top">This shot touches te heart.</td>', 'This shot touches te heart.', '2008-10-23 16:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022360, 732721, 31664, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good use of desaturation.</td>', 'Nice composition and good use of desaturation.', '2008-10-23 16:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022361, 732784, 31664, '<td valign="top">I had to look a couple of times before I saw the person,  would have been better if they stood out a little.</td>', 'I had to look a couple of times before I saw the person,  would have been better if they stood out a little.', '2008-10-23 16:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022363, 732827, 31664, '<td valign="top">Nice idea,  the large blyred area in the front is a bit distracting though.</td>', 'Nice idea,  the large blyred area in the front is a bit distracting though.', '2008-10-23 16:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022366, 732805, 31664, '<td valign="top">Nice irony, I love it! Not sure about the composition but the message in the capture more than makes up for it!</td>', 'Nice irony, I love it! Not sure about the composition but the message in the capture more than makes up for it!', '2008-10-23 16:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022557, 732746, 99821, '<td valign="top">To much contrast for me.</td>', 'To much contrast for me.', '2008-10-23 19:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022587, 731773, 89230, '<td valign="top">You know, I marked this as a 5. I then realized I was getting into the DPC mindset. This is a great photo. It really tells a story, a lot more than others. Great shot. 8</td>', 'You know, I marked this as a 5. I then realized I was getting into the DPC mindset. This is a great photo. It really tells a story, a lot more than others. Great shot. 8', '2008-10-23 19:40:33.000000', NULL, 1);
