(5022592, 732249, 89230, '<td valign="top">Love the subject. Like the crop. But it is a bit blurry. Seems the shoe is the only thing in focus.</td>', 'Love the subject. Like the crop. But it is a bit blurry. Seems the shoe is the only thing in focus.', '2008-10-23 19:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022599, 732124, 89230, '<td valign="top">i recommend that you NEED to make the picture the max allowable size.</td>', 'i recommend that you NEED to make the picture the max allowable size.', '2008-10-23 19:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022600, 732809, 89230, '<td valign="top">interesting title. i think the picture is quite touching with the vehicle section of the trailer boarded up and all....</td>', 'interesting title. i think the picture is quite touching with the vehicle section of the trailer boarded up and all....', '2008-10-23 20:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022602, 732645, 89230, '<td valign="top">like it, but maybe a bit overexposed</td>', 'like it, but maybe a bit overexposed', '2008-10-23 20:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022603, 732756, 89230, '<td valign="top">love it</td>', 'love it', '2008-10-23 20:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022626, 732680, 94265, '<td valign="top">The only thing that spoils this shot for me is that his t-shirt, while cut up, still looks clean and new. The trousers look grubby, as does his face and his hair is messy, which all fits nicely but his top looks clean. Other than that, great shot, good focus and contrast.</td>', 'The only thing that spoils this shot for me is that his t-shirt, while cut up, still looks clean and new. The trousers look grubby, as does his face and his hair is messy, which all fits nicely but his top looks clean. Other than that, great shot, good focus and contrast.', '2008-10-23 20:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022631, 732628, 94265, '<td valign="top">This one is really sad, more so because they''re so young. I love that motion blur, a man moving past so quick he doesn''t even notice the tired, starving young runaways, that''s what this photo makes me think. Good contrast and the b&amp;w makes it seem even more hopless. Nice work :)</td>', 'This one is really sad, more so because they''re so young. I love that motion blur, a man moving past so quick he doesn''t even notice the tired, starving young runaways, that''s what this photo makes me think. Good contrast and the b&w makes it seem even more hopless. Nice work :)', '2008-10-23 20:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022632, 732451, 49773, '<td valign="top">I think that a photograph should form the title, not vice versa. The link to this challenge is mostly the title, and without it the photograph could have multiple interpretations.</td>', 'I think that a photograph should form the title, not vice versa. The link to this challenge is mostly the title, and without it the photograph could have multiple interpretations.', '2008-10-23 20:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022716, 732634, 49773, '<td valign="top">One of the most artistic photos I''ve seen here in a while. Overcomes by far the stupidish "concept" shots in this challenge.</td>', 'One of the most artistic photos I''ve seen here in a while. Overcomes by far the stupidish "concept" shots in this challenge.', '2008-10-23 22:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022787, 731773, 49773, '<td valign="top">Looks like work of <b>xion</b> but he''s not around anymore...</td>', 'Looks like work of xion but he''s not around anymore...', '2008-10-23 22:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022788, 732698, 49773, '<td valign="top">The last thing I should comment on this photo is the composition but I have to say that it''s wonderful. Very strong photograph.</td>', 'The last thing I should comment on this photo is the composition but I have to say that it''s wonderful. Very strong photograph.', '2008-10-23 22:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022899, 732249, 90626, '<td valign="top">this one looks real to me and is very moving. great capture.</td>', 'this one looks real to me and is very moving. great capture.', '2008-10-23 23:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022949, 732667, 63633, '<td valign="top">I think the border really detracts from the image.</td>', 'I think the border really detracts from the image.', '2008-10-24 00:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022951, 732649, 63633, '<td valign="top">Very pretty image, but not real convincing, sorry. I live in Sydney and I haven''t seen any street kids lately, particularly ones dressed so well :)</td>', 'Very pretty image, but not real convincing, sorry. I live in Sydney and I haven''t seen any street kids lately, particularly ones dressed so well :)', '2008-10-24 00:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022954, 732852, 63633, '<td valign="top">I just have a feeling that this one is Millsa''s, so I won''t vote, but I really like this. Pity that the non-Aussies won''t understand what The Big Issue is, and what it means to this guy.</td>', 'I just have a feeling that this one is Millsa''s, so I won''t vote, but I really like this. Pity that the non-Aussies won''t understand what The Big Issue is, and what it means to this guy.', '2008-10-24 00:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022955, 732810, 63633, '<td valign="top">Eww!! That''s really disgusting, and I''m not easily grossed out!</td>', 'Eww!! That''s really disgusting, and I''m not easily grossed out!', '2008-10-24 00:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5022959, 731760, 63633, '<td valign="top">This one is Toddster45''s so I won''t vote. Hope the credit card was expired!!<br/>Might not be such a good idea to put your medicare number on the Internet though :(</td>', 'This one is Toddster45''s so I won''t vote. Hope the credit card was expired!!Might not be such a good idea to put your medicare number on the Internet though :(', '2008-10-24 00:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
