(5023166, 732116, 93756, '<td valign="top">Your title actually made me want to score this lower. I think the photo should tell the story on its own and not rely so much on a wordy title.</td>', 'Your title actually made me want to score this lower. I think the photo should tell the story on its own and not rely so much on a wordy title.', '2008-10-24 09:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
