(5023275, 732812, 93756, '<td valign="top">I like the abstractish quality of the close-up. I like the framing of the torch off-center. Try this again for the "Money" challenge and you might do well! It probably does convey money better than poverty.</td>', 'I like the abstractish quality of the close-up. I like the framing of the torch off-center. Try this again for the "Money" challenge and you might do well! It probably does convey money better than poverty.', '2008-10-24 11:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023296, 732419, 93756, '<td valign="top">If it wasn''t basic editing, I would suggest blurring the background or using vignette to get rid of the bright street lights in the upper right. As it is, terrific capture of the expression on her face and her poverty.</td>', 'If it wasn''t basic editing, I would suggest blurring the background or using vignette to get rid of the bright street lights in the upper right. As it is, terrific capture of the expression on her face and her poverty.', '2008-10-24 11:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023297, 732382, 93756, '<td valign="top">Love how the backs of people/umbrellas are turned to him.</td>', 'Love how the backs of people/umbrellas are turned to him.', '2008-10-24 11:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023298, 732634, 93756, '<td valign="top">I really like the effect here - how did you do this? I wish the hands were more centered or closer cropped - they just aren''t quite in the right place in the frame to appeal to my eye. Maybe flip it so the hands are imploring the heavens?</td>', 'I really like the effect here - how did you do this? I wish the hands were more centered or closer cropped - they just aren''t quite in the right place in the frame to appeal to my eye. Maybe flip it so the hands are imploring the heavens?', '2008-10-24 11:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023301, 731857, 93756, '<td valign="top">So much is great here - you really captured the joy in these children and the love they have for each other. The warm lighting is really nice. I wish the composition was more centered and I wish the girl to the right was a little sharper but great job.</td>', 'So much is great here - you really captured the joy in these children and the love they have for each other. The warm lighting is really nice. I wish the composition was more centered and I wish the girl to the right was a little sharper but great job.', '2008-10-24 12:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
