(5023675, 732871, 55956, '<td valign="top">well, I don''t know if this photo is real or that man is a model but this is a great photo. securely the best that I see at the 30% of voting. great the lights and the shadows, the man or better the figure of the man confused between shadows and lights. great photo.</td>', 'well, I don''t know if this photo is real or that man is a model but this is a great photo. securely the best that I see at the 30% of voting. great the lights and the shadows, the man or better the figure of the man confused between shadows and lights. great photo.', '2008-10-24 17:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
