(5023870, 732570, 31776, '<td valign="top">This is a great pic and I won''t be suprised if it wins this weeks challenge. Everything from the expression and dirt on your models face to the clothing is perfect. If I had any criticism at all it would be that maybe the background is a little too blurry on the right side.</td>', 'This is a great pic and I won''t be suprised if it wins this weeks challenge. Everything from the expression and dirt on your models face to the clothing is perfect. If I had any criticism at all it would be that maybe the background is a little too blurry on the right side.', '2008-10-24 19:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023873, 732827, 31776, '<td valign="top">Don''t really like the foreground blur in this pic, it almost looks like motion blur. Other than that nice pic.</td>', 'Don''t really like the foreground blur in this pic, it almost looks like motion blur. Other than that nice pic.', '2008-10-24 19:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023878, 731819, 31776, '<td valign="top">Nice pic but I don''t understand how it represents poverty especially with the two motor bikes in the background.</td>', 'Nice pic but I don''t understand how it represents poverty especially with the two motor bikes in the background.', '2008-10-24 19:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023884, 732699, 31776, '<td valign="top">This is a great pic although I think the model could have been dressed a little differently, a few tattered clothes and a bit of dirt would have gone a long way.</td>', 'This is a great pic although I think the model could have been dressed a little differently, a few tattered clothes and a bit of dirt would have gone a long way.', '2008-10-24 19:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5023895, 732782, 31776, '<td valign="top">This is a great pic and could well be amongst the ribbons this week. The only thing I would have liked to see is the smallest girl in either bare feet or older shoes and maybe an older looking top. Certainly IMO one of the better images in this weeks challenge though.</td>', 'This is a great pic and could well be amongst the ribbons this week. The only thing I would have liked to see is the smallest girl in either bare feet or older shoes and maybe an older looking top. Certainly IMO one of the better images in this weeks challenge though.', '2008-10-24 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
