(5027249, 732779, 36382, '<td valign="top">I''d also like to see this zoomed out a little to show more of the environment.  Also seems a bit bright.  Seems like a great little location for pictures, though.</td>', 'I''d also like to see this zoomed out a little to show more of the environment.  Also seems a bit bright.  Seems like a great little location for pictures, though.', '2008-10-27 13:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
