(5028722, 732051, 99812, '<td valign="top">Contrasts.  The woman on the looks homeless and hungry. The lady on the street has some pizza.  I think you should not have cut the lady on the right off in the middle.  She accually looks more of a distraction.  This would have been a stronger picture with just the lady on the left.  I put a piece of paper covering the person on the right and cropped her out.  This accually made for a stronger picture.  Your sole attention would have been on the homeless person.  Try it out when you get the chance.</td>', 'Contrasts.  The woman on the looks homeless and hungry. The lady on the street has some pizza.  I think you should not have cut the lady on the right off in the middle.  She accually looks more of a distraction.  This would have been a stronger picture with just the lady on the left.  I put a piece of paper covering the person on the right and cropped her out.  This accually made for a stronger picture.  Your sole attention would have been on the homeless person.  Try it out when you get the chance.', '2008-10-28 09:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028728, 732805, 99812, '<td valign="top">What contrasts.  The advertisement for Charles Schwab and the homeless man on a bench.  I like that you showed some of his personel belonging on the right side of the picture frame.  the mans posture show it all.  He is totally dejected and lost.  What a contrast of life.</td>', 'What contrasts.  The advertisement for Charles Schwab and the homeless man on a bench.  I like that you showed some of his personel belonging on the right side of the picture frame.  the mans posture show it all.  He is totally dejected and lost.  What a contrast of life.', '2008-10-28 09:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
