(5028842, 731773, 99812, '<td valign="top">Sad picture here.  His is disabled withpart of his leg amputated.  The artifical one in on the right side of the picture next tot he water bottle.  He is sitting next to his house with all of his belonging next to him.  It shows how as differnt cultures we take care of the poor and homeless.</td>', 'Sad picture here.  His is disabled withpart of his leg amputated.  The artifical one in on the right side of the picture next tot he water bottle.  He is sitting next to his house with all of his belonging next to him.  It shows how as differnt cultures we take care of the poor and homeless.', '2008-10-28 10:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028845, 732884, 99812, '<td valign="top">This looks more of a Halloween picture than a true picture on poverty.  Kids that run away from home don''t dress or look this way anymore.  To me this would have been more approtiate for a Halloween contest.  You have nice sharp focus on the person and nice colors in the leaves in the backround.</td>', 'This looks more of a Halloween picture than a true picture on poverty.  Kids that run away from home don''t dress or look this way anymore.  To me this would have been more approtiate for a Halloween contest.  You have nice sharp focus on the person and nice colors in the leaves in the backround.', '2008-10-28 10:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028847, 732330, 99812, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in this picture.  Nice dov and focus.  You can see by the way the house boat looks that they live a hard life on the river.  Looks like they survive day to day by fishing.  Nice reflection on the still waters as well.</td>', 'Nice colors in this picture.  Nice dov and focus.  You can see by the way the house boat looks that they live a hard life on the river.  Looks like they survive day to day by fishing.  Nice reflection on the still waters as well.', '2008-10-28 10:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028849, 732872, 99812, '<td valign="top">This is a hard life for any child.  A cardboard and wooden house. It looks like it is ready to fall down in a bad storm.  The garbage all around the building shows a slum for the poor.  I see hope and sadness in this picture.  Hope is that the young child is the future and sadness that she lives in such squalor.</td>', 'This is a hard life for any child.  A cardboard and wooden house. It looks like it is ready to fall down in a bad storm.  The garbage all around the building shows a slum for the poor.  I see hope and sadness in this picture.  Hope is that the young child is the future and sadness that she lives in such squalor.', '2008-10-28 10:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028852, 731796, 99812, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the woman begging for money.  He expression shows sadness and a hard life.  I see you used a slow shutter speed in this picture.  The hand  and fingers look more like a claw it distracts my attention of the person begging.  It looks more like something from a horror movie.  It looks like it will do harm to the person that help them out.  I like the lighting on the begger and shadows.</td>', 'Nice focus on the woman begging for money.  He expression shows sadness and a hard life.  I see you used a slow shutter speed in this picture.  The hand  and fingers look more like a claw it distracts my attention of the person begging.  It looks more like something from a horror movie.  It looks like it will do harm to the person that help them out.  I like the lighting on the begger and shadows.', '2008-10-28 10:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028853, 732645, 99812, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture here.  You caught a nice expression on his face.  He definatly looks happy but we could be wrong here.  he could be a person in need of meental help.  Nice sharp focus on him the colors in the backround are nicely out of focus.  Perhase if you cropped a little bit closer on the right hand side of the frame just to the lines on the building it would make for a tighter and better pictuere.  I bet this would look great in B&amp;W as well.</td>', 'Very nice capture here.  You caught a nice expression on his face.  He definatly looks happy but we could be wrong here.  he could be a person in need of meental help.  Nice sharp focus on him the colors in the backround are nicely out of focus.  Perhase if you cropped a little bit closer on the right hand side of the frame just to the lines on the building it would make for a tighter and better pictuere.  I bet this would look great in B&W as well.', '2008-10-28 10:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028861, 732419, 99812, '<td valign="top">Nioce colors and expression in this one.  The lines of age show on her face.  You can see a sense of dignaty in her.  I like the way she makes eye contact with the photographer. I like the blurred backround.  You can tell she is on the street which is good.</td>', 'Nioce colors and expression in this one.  The lines of age show on her face.  You can see a sense of dignaty in her.  I like the way she makes eye contact with the photographer. I like the blurred backround.  You can tell she is on the street which is good.', '2008-10-28 10:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028862, 732835, 99812, '<td valign="top">This picture show someone playing the game of Monoply.  Does this fit the description of Poverty?  I realize interpertation is to the photographer.  But to me the answer is no.  How does it show real life poverty?  Fake money and a game board?  This should be in another comeptiton.</td>', 'This picture show someone playing the game of Monoply.  Does this fit the description of Poverty?  I realize interpertation is to the photographer.  But to me the answer is no.  How does it show real life poverty?  Fake money and a game board?  This should be in another comeptiton.', '2008-10-28 10:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028863, 732723, 99812, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  The lighting and focus in this are great.  She looks very sad and helpless.  This would work in B&amp;W as well.</td>', 'Nice picture.  The lighting and focus in this are great.  She looks very sad and helpless.  This would work in B&W as well.', '2008-10-28 10:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028866, 732773, 99812, '<td valign="top">Sad picture here.  His only posession are his dog and a stuffed animal.  Laying on the street.  Nice focus and cropping.</td>', 'Sad picture here.  His only posession are his dog and a stuffed animal.  Laying on the street.  Nice focus and cropping.', '2008-10-28 10:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028870, 732629, 99812, '<td valign="top">Nice capture in his face.  Nice lighting and selective focus.  The cup he is using is nicely out of focus.  His eyes are very haunting.  Nice close up portrait.</td>', 'Nice capture in his face.  Nice lighting and selective focus.  The cup he is using is nicely out of focus.  His eyes are very haunting.  Nice close up portrait.', '2008-10-28 10:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028879, 732261, 99812, '<td valign="top">Nice night scene.  I like the use of the buildings as leading lines into the alley.  The homeless person is almost silhuetted.  You can see his cart and dog next to him as he bends over to pick soemthing up.  Nice play on words in the sign "Grand &amp; Toys.  You used a very wide angle in this one.  There are a few things that distract me in this picture.  The grate in the bottom right forground if you cropped it out it would bring my eyes closer on the scene of the man and the cart.  Also the top part of the power lines and light pole could be taken out as well.  It wouls still leave in the top of the loading docka nd the sign you mentioned in the name of the picture.  These are my suggestions to make it a stronger picture.</td>', 'Nice night scene.  I like the use of the buildings as leading lines into the alley.  The homeless person is almost silhuetted.  You can see his cart and dog next to him as he bends over to pick soemthing up.  Nice play on words in the sign "Grand & Toys.  You used a very wide angle in this one.  There are a few things that distract me in this picture.  The grate in the bottom right forground if you cropped it out it would bring my eyes closer on the scene of the man and the cart.  Also the top part of the power lines and light pole could be taken out as well.  It wouls still leave in the top of the loading docka nd the sign you mentioned in the name of the picture.  These are my suggestions to make it a stronger picture.', '2008-10-28 10:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028889, 732637, 99812, '<td valign="top">Nice street picture.  I like the details in this one.  Nice focus and compostition. It amazes me that he can sleep this way.</td>', 'Nice street picture.  I like the details in this one.  Nice focus and compostition. It amazes me that he can sleep this way.', '2008-10-28 10:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028900, 731748, 99812, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  The looks on their face shows hope.  With the support of your family you can succeed.  They may be poor but they look happy.  Sometime all the riches in the world can not bring about the wealth they have in the love they have for eachohter.  Nice natural lighting and foucs.  Nice tight frame.</td>', 'Nice portrait.  The looks on their face shows hope.  With the support of your family you can succeed.  They may be poor but they look happy.  Sometime all the riches in the world can not bring about the wealth they have in the love they have for eachohter.  Nice natural lighting and foucs.  Nice tight frame.', '2008-10-28 11:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029047, 732766, 57777, '<td valign="top">beautiful tones, and the garage sale sign is a fun addition to the picture. I love some of the deep shadows. Good shot</td>', 'beautiful tones, and the garage sale sign is a fun addition to the picture. I love some of the deep shadows. Good shot', '2008-10-28 12:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
