(5030042, 732805, 20662, '<td valign="top">thanks for all the great comments on this shot. I had no intention of shooting anything for this challenge but as we were driving through downtown Los Angeles the irony of the sign with the man and all his belongings really struck me. I wish I''d had a better opportunity to get a clearer shot -- this was a quick drive by moment and the original was cropped quite a bit to isolate the subject.</td>', 'thanks for all the great comments on this shot. I had no intention of shooting anything for this challenge but as we were driving through downtown Los Angeles the irony of the sign with the man and all his belongings really struck me. I wish I''d had a better opportunity to get a clearer shot -- this was a quick drive by moment and the original was cropped quite a bit to isolate the subject.', '2008-10-29 00:48:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5030060, 732751, 94265, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BrianR:</b></div><hr/><i> Laura I keep coming in to look at your photos, because I believe you are very good and will soon hit the button of excellence.I cropped your photo after I read the comments,this may have overcome them.If you do not like me doing this just PM me and let me know.[thumb]734759[/thumb] </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No problem at all Brian, I''m flattered you''ve taken some interest in my shots. Your crop is pretty good, I just felt that the blank space behind her really helped emphasise the coldness of the room but maybe the unplugged heater was overkill.</td>', 'Originally posted by BrianR: Laura I keep coming in to look at your photos, because I believe you are very good and will soon hit the button of excellence.I cropped your photo after I read the comments,this may have overcome them.If you do not like me doing this just PM me and let me know.[thumb]734759[/thumb]   No problem at all Brian, I''m flattered you''ve taken some interest in my shots. Your crop is pretty good, I just felt that the blank space behind her really helped emphasise the coldness of the room but maybe the unplugged heater was overkill.', '2008-10-29 00:52:57.000000', NULL, 0),
