(5030849, 732419, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Chris!  This is amazing!  And I seriously beg to differ with you about the "mediocre photographer" thing.  This was taken and presented to masterfully!  I''m so glad you left it in color.  It''s just beautiful!  Congratulations!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh Chris!  This is amazing!  And I seriously beg to differ with you about the "mediocre photographer" thing.  This was taken and presented to masterfully!  I''m so glad you left it in color.  It''s just beautiful!  Congratulations! ', '2008-10-29 11:18:16.000000', NULL, 0),
