(5033746, 732781, 45475, '<td valign="top">Congratulations for the ribbon! How could you think this was a shoehorn?<br/> <br/>LOL, can''t get over the iPod... wonder how he charges it? :D</td>', 'Congratulations for the ribbon! How could you think this was a shoehorn? LOL, can''t get over the iPod... wonder how he charges it? :D', '2008-10-30 23:03:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5034094, 732639, 39427, '<td valign="top">I do like the title and I do like the shot, I think the size diminishes the impact of the photograph on the site b/c the people don''t stand out right away.  go Poland</td>', 'I do like the title and I do like the shot, I think the size diminishes the impact of the photograph on the site b/c the people don''t stand out right away.  go Poland', '2008-10-31 08:50:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5034096, 732799, 39427, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9 for the grit and texture.  Ended up lower than i expected but still top 25</td>', 'I gave this a 9 for the grit and texture.  Ended up lower than i expected but still top 25', '2008-10-31 08:51:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5034100, 732852, 39427, '<td valign="top">The light, the composition, the smoke... all brilliant in my opinion.  This shot is painfully underrated, but I suspect it is due to the actual image''s somewhat tenuous link to the concept of poverty (he doesn''t look poor off the bat).  I''m sure if this was zoomed out people would see it more clearly, but the photo as it stands is a fave.</td>', 'The light, the composition, the smoke... all brilliant in my opinion.  This shot is painfully underrated, but I suspect it is due to the actual image''s somewhat tenuous link to the concept of poverty (he doesn''t look poor off the bat).  I''m sure if this was zoomed out people would see it more clearly, but the photo as it stands is a fave.', '2008-10-31 08:55:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5034102, 732852, 39427, '<td valign="top">Just to add, I want a 50mm 1.8 lens so bad, or ''portrait'' lense for that matter... shots like this inspire me to shoot humans (w/ a camera, of course :P)</td>', 'Just to add, I want a 50mm 1.8 lens so bad, or ''portrait'' lense for that matter... shots like this inspire me to shoot humans (w/ a camera, of course :P)', '2008-10-31 08:57:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5034116, 732832, 80087, '<td valign="top">I like it Max, and I know you ask permission before you shoot people.</td>', 'I like it Max, and I know you ask permission before you shoot people.', '2008-10-31 09:18:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5034128, 732872, 80087, '<td valign="top">I like the pic. the little girl probably doesn''t know anything else so she doesn''t think she is poor. It is a sad life though. We should consider ourselves lucky, I know I do when I see people who don''t have what I do.</td>', 'I like the pic. the little girl probably doesn''t know anything else so she doesn''t think she is poor. It is a sad life though. We should consider ourselves lucky, I know I do when I see people who don''t have what I do.', '2008-10-31 09:29:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5034473, 732781, 42013, '<td valign="top">congrats Marac -- an ipod and a flat tire!</td>', 'congrats Marac -- an ipod and a flat tire!', '2008-10-31 14:01:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5034801, 732419, 37845, '<td valign="top">2 ribbons in a short while, and both for excellent shots. I like that you are winning ribbons for very different photographs... shows a lot of diversity. Congrats on the recent results, and hope to see more front page stuff from you.</td>', '2 ribbons in a short while, and both for excellent shots. I like that you are winning ribbons for very different photographs... shows a lot of diversity. Congrats on the recent results, and hope to see more front page stuff from you.', '2008-10-31 17:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5034892, 732872, 36060, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot, congrats!</td>', 'Brilliant shot, congrats!', '2008-10-31 19:32:14.000000', NULL, 0),
